sss_experiment/3D-student-splatting-and-scooping/
# Heavy artifacts: run tarballs, trained plys/ckpts, COLMAP binaries — all regenerable
sss_experiment/*.tar.gz
sss_experiment/prod_out/
sss_experiment/data/*/sparse/
sss_experiment/data/**/*.bin

# ---- Heavy regenerable artifacts (never track; repo convention) ----
